ges, as indicated above. This is termed: "Cradle to gate with options, modules C1 to C4, and module D". A schematic of these stages is presented in the flow diagram below.', 'EPD Ireland PCR Part A, Version 2.1, 2022', 'EPD Ireland PCR Part A, Version 2.1, 2022', 'Independent external review', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6.000000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1.000000, 1.000000, 'Number of pieces', 'pcs', 'm2', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 12:05:27', '2025-09-23 12:05:27'),
