 Process (A4 - A5), End of Life (C1 - C4), and benefits and loads beyond the system boundary (D).', 'PCR - Part A Implementation and use of I.S. EN 15804:2012+A1 and + A2, and CEN TR 16970:2016 in Ireland for the development of Environmental Product Declarations (issued 05.03.2022), Version 2.1', 'PCR - Part A Implementation and use of I.S. EN 15804:2012+A1 and + A2, and CEN TR 16970:2016 in Ireland for the development of Environmental Product Declarations (issued 05.03.2022), Version 2.1', 'Independent external review', 850.000000, 0.000000, 0.025000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.000000, 1.000000, NULL, 850.000000, 0.120000, 0.000000, NULL, NULL, 1.000000, 1.000000, 'Volume', 'm3', 'kg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 12:05:27', '2025-09-23 12:05:27'),
